abstract: >
  Data and R analysis script exploring understorey plant community composition
  along a riparian distance gradient in Halstock Wood SSSI. Includes species
  abundance and environmental (soil moisture, soil pH, canopy cover, distance
  from river) survey data, plus 3D NMDS ordination, envfit, PERMANOVA, and
  betadisper analyses.
